# APIX prompts live here as one *.prompt.yaml per prompt, e.g.:
#   dimension-sales.prompt.yaml, dimension-compliance.prompt.yaml,
#   evidence-extraction.prompt.yaml, scoring.prompt.yaml, coaching-report.prompt.yaml
# Generate via COPILOT_PROMPTS.md (or python ../../copilot_prompts.py --usecase apix).
# Canonical example (coaching-report v3) is in ../../5thAug/v2/research-brief.md.
# This .gitkeep keeps the empty folder in Git until the first prompt is added.
